<InfoPage
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Read the Typing Multiplayer privacy policy and learn how the typing race handles browser, analytics, and multiplayer data."
>
  <p><strong>Last updated: September 16, 2026</strong></p>
  <p>Typing Multiplayer respects your privacy. This policy explains what information may be processed when you use the typing race, FAQ, and related pages.</p>
  <h2 class="mt-8 font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-ink">Information we process</h2>
  <p>You may enter a display name and room code when joining a race. During a multiplayer race, room information and player progress, such as WPM, accuracy, readiness, and completion status, are synchronized through Supabase so other players in the room can see the race.</p>
  <p>The theme preference may be stored in your browser's local storage. We do not require an account or ask for a password to use the public typing race.</p>
  <h2 class="mt-8 font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-ink">Analytics</h2>
  <p>We use Google Analytics to understand general website usage, such as visits and page views. Google may process technical information according to its own privacy policies. You can control cookies and similar storage through your browser settings.</p>
  <h2 class="mt-8 font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-ink">Data retention and choices</h2>
  <p>Room and player data is used to operate live races and may expire or be removed when a room ends. You can leave a room at any time. Do not enter sensitive personal information into a display name or typing passage.</p>
  <h2 class="mt-8 font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-ink">Contact</h2>
  <p>For privacy questions, contact us at <a class="font-bold text-blue underline" href="mailto:contact@typingmultiplayer.com">contact@typingmultiplayer.com</a>.</p>
</InfoPage>
